Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,约 1.4 公斤，仅占体重的 2%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.15,EN,,0,0,0,,About 1.4 kg, just 2% of your body weight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,约 860 亿个神经元
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Around 86 billion neurons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,却消耗全身约 20% 的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:09.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Yet it burns about 20% of your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,它依靠分工明确的脑区协同运作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.75,EN,,0,0,0,,It runs on specialised regions working together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,感知、记忆、情绪、决策……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Sensing, remembering, feeling, deciding…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,分别由谁负责？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Who is in charge of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,从脑区到前额叶皮层
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:22.35,EN,,0,0,0,,From brain regions to the prefrontal cortex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一章 · 认识大脑的主要脑区
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:25.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Chapter 1 · The major brain regions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,大脑皮层分为四个脑叶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.75,EN,,0,0,0,,The cerebral cortex has four lobes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,下方还有小脑与脑干
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Beneath sit the cerebellum and brainstem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,思考、计划与自主运动的中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Hub of thought, planning and voluntary movement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,后缘的初级运动皮层，指挥全身肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:38.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Its rear strip, the motor cortex, commands your muscles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,整合触觉、痛觉与身体位置感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Integrates touch, pain and body position
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,还负责空间注意：知道东西“在哪里”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.75,EN,,0,0,0,,And spatial attention: knowing where things are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,处理声音、理解语言、参与记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Processes sound, language comprehension and memory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,韦尼克区受损：说话流利，却难以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Wernicke's area damage: fluent speech, poor comprehension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,视觉中枢：初级视皮层 V1 所在地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,The visual centre, home of primary visual cortex V1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,视觉信息由此分为“是什么”与“在哪里”两路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.55,EN,,0,0,0,,From here, vision splits into 'what' and 'where' pathways
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,协调动作、维持平衡、学习运动技能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Coordinates movement, balance and motor skill learning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,只占脑重约 10%，却拥有约 80% 的神经元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.95,EN,,0,0,0,,About 10% of brain mass, yet ~80% of its neurons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,由中脑、脑桥、延髓组成，连接脊髓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Midbrain, pons and medulla, linking brain to spinal cord
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,自动调控呼吸、心跳与觉醒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:10.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Runs breathing, heartbeat and wakefulness on autopilot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉信息进入皮层前的中继站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:13.55,EN,,0,0,0,,The relay hub for signals heading to the cortex
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,除嗅觉外，几乎所有感觉都先经过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Nearly every sense except smell passes through here first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:19.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,仅约 4 克，掌管体温、饥饿与睡眠节律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:19.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Just ~4 g, it runs temperature, hunger and sleep cycles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,通过垂体，调控全身的激素分泌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:23.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Through the pituitary, it steers the body's hormones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:26.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,把当下的经历写成长期记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:26.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Turns today's experiences into long-term memories
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,H.M. 双侧海马大部切除后，记不住新经历
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.55,EN,,0,0,0,,With most of both hippocampi gone, H.M. formed no new memories
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,侦测威胁、触发恐惧的“警报器”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.75,EN,,0,0,0,,The alarm that detects threats and triggers fear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,让带有情绪的事件被记得格外牢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.95,EN,,0,0,0,,It makes emotional events stick in memory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一个脑区，与“人之为人”关系最密切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.15,EN,,0,0,0,,One region is most tied to what makes us human
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:42.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,它最晚发育成熟，一直持续到 20 多岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:42.35,EN,,0,0,0,,It is among the last to mature, well into your 20s
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,计划、专注、克制、抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:45.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Planning, focus, self-control, choice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,都离不开它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,All of them depend on it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二章 · 大脑的指挥中心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Chapter 2 · The brain's command centre
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,位于额叶前部，运动相关区域之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:55.15,EN,,0,0,0,,The front of the frontal lobe, ahead of the motor areas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,统筹注意、记忆与情绪，服务于目标
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:58.35,EN,,0,0,0,,It coordinates attention, memory and emotion toward goals
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,它可细分为多个功能亚区
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:01.55,EN,,0,0,0,,It divides into specialised subregions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,位于额中回，对应布罗德曼 9 区与 46 区
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Middle frontal gyrus, Brodmann areas 9 and 46
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:07.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,工作记忆：在脑中暂存并加工信息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:07.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Working memory: holding and working with information
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,延迟任务中，神经元在等待期持续放电
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:11.15,EN,,0,0,0,,In delay tasks, its neurons keep firing through the wait
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,认知控制：制定计划，按规则切换任务
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:14.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Cognitive control: making plans and switching rules
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,位于额下回，紧邻外侧裂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Inferior frontal gyrus, just above the lateral fissure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,右侧额下回：叫停冲动，抑制反应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:20.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Right inferior frontal gyrus: stopping impulsive responses
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,左侧 44/45 区即布洛卡区，负责言语产生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Left areas 44/45 form Broca's area, for speech production
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,还帮助从记忆中挑选、提取所需信息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:27.15,EN,,0,0,0,,It also selects and retrieves what you need from memory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:30.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,前额叶的最前端，在人类中相对更大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:30.35,EN,,0,0,0,,The very tip of the PFC, relatively enlarged in humans
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,挂起主目标，先处理子任务，再切回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.55,EN,,0,0,0,,It parks a main goal, handles a subtask, then returns
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,元认知：评估“我有多确定”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Metacognition: judging how sure you are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,权衡探索新选项，还是利用旧经验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Weighing exploring the new against exploiting the known
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:43.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,位于额叶底面，就在眼眶上方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:43.15,EN,,0,0,0,,On the frontal lobe's underside, right above the eye sockets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,计算奖励价值：这对我值多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:46.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Computes reward value: what is this worth to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,规则一变，迅速更新预期（逆转学习）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:49.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Rapidly updates when rules flip: reversal learning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗅觉与味觉在此汇聚，形成“美味”的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Smell and taste converge here into the pleasure of flavour
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,位于前额叶内侧下部，与内侧 OFC 部分重叠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:55.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Lower medial PFC, overlapping with the medial OFC
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,1848 年，铁棍贯穿盖奇头颅，他从此性情大变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.15,EN,,0,0,0,,1848: an iron rod changed Phineas Gage's personality
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,躯体标记假说：情绪信号引导决策
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Somatic marker hypothesis: emotional signals guide choices
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,还参与调节恐惧，平复负面情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:05.55,EN,,0,0,0,,It also helps regulate fear and calm negative emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,环绕胼胝体前部，常被归入内侧前额叶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:08.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Curves around the front of the corpus callosum
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:11.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,冲突监测：察觉“冲动”与“目标”打架
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:11.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Conflict monitoring: noticing when impulse and goal collide
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,一出错，脑电立刻出现“错误相关负波”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:15.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Slip up, and an error signal (the ERN) fires within ~100 ms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:18.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,还编码疼痛有多“难受”，而不是痛在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:18.35,EN,,0,0,0,,It also encodes how much pain hurts, not where it hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,六个亚区，各司其职
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Six subregions, each with its own job
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,但它们并非单打独斗，而是组成网络
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.75,EN,,0,0,0,,But none works alone: they form networks
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,并与杏仁核、海马、丘脑紧密相连
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:27.95,EN,,0,0,0,,And they are wired to the amygdala, hippocampus and thalamus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,认识大脑，就是认识自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:31.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Know your brain, know yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,图示已简化，非精确解剖比例
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:34.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Diagrams are simplified, not to anatomical scale
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢观看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching
